<hr>
<h3>Allowed Tags</h3>
<p>Use the following tags in the email body. The example shows your current values.</p>
<table class="table table-striped">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th>Key</th>
      <th>Value</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <%- current_user.email_attributes.each do |key, value| %>
      <tr>
        <td><code><%= "{{#{key}}}" %></code></td>
        <td><%= value %></td>
      </tr>
    <%- end %>
    <tr>
      <td><code>{{piazza_password}}</code></td>
      <td>(The current piazza sign up password)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>{{denial_reason}}</code></td>
      <td>(Only on denial emails.)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>{{request_reason}}</code></td>
      <td>(Only on request emails.)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>{{view_teacher_url}}</code></td>
      <td>(Link to the teacher's page in the admin view. <strong>Admin-only:</strong> only use in emails sent to admins.)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><code>{{edit_teacher_url}}</code></td>
      <td>(Link for the teacher to review or update their own information. Safe to send to teachers.)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
